<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#deforestation">Glossary</a> · Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Deforestation</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Deforestation is the large-scale clearing of forests. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kushite-empire">Kushite Empire</a>, deforestation linked to the fuel demands of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iron-smelting">iron production</a> around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/meroe">Meroë</a> is cited, together with possible shifts in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nile">Nile</a> flooding, as an environmental factor that undermined the agricultural and economic base of the state in its later period.</p></div>
